   "Blood Glucose Detection on a Printed Paper Strip Blood Glucose Detection on a Printed Paper Strip, from the mobile app that guides the user through the test, through the paper strip and detection box, to the smartphone-based analysis of the result. See the project carousel below for the individual components (Mobile App, Paper Strip, Detection Box, Smartphone based analysis).",
