   "COVIRAP: A Nucleic-Acid Based Rapid Diagnostic Test for COVID-19 COVIRAP: A Nucleic-Acid Based Rapid Diagnostic Test for COVID-19.",
   "Clinical Algorithm based App for Delivering Primary Care at Resource Poor Settings-Uday Clinical Algorithm based App for Delivering Primary Care at Resource Poor Settings — Uday.",
   "Covicube “COVICUBE” – which can simultaneously measure respiration rate, Oxygen saturation, breathing rate, Temperature has been prototyped and validated in rural settings. This will provide a much-needed low-cost integrated solution for screening the rural population through the same women rural health workers.",
   "Lipidest Lipidest.",
   "Apply glycerin on the paper pad of the cartridge with paint brush. Make sure that the glycerin is completely absorbed within the paper and no surplus volume of glycerin remains on the paper surface.",
   "Properly align the paper cartridge and the smartphone on the designated slot of the image acquisition platform.",
   "Open the camera of the smartphone and adjust the magnification to 2.5X.",
   "Perform finger pricking and deposit one drop of finger pricked blood on the wet paper cartridge just by touching the blood drop on the paper surface.",
   "Capture the image of the blood pattern after 3-4 secs of dispensing blood.",
   "Open smartphone app ‘Hemo-app’.",
   "Click on ‘Start a new test’.",
   "Click on ‘Upload image from Gallery’.",
   "Choose the recently captured blood pattern image.",
   "Wait for the result display on the smartphone app.",
   "Dispense the used paper cartridge into biosafety-waste bin.",
